71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kM-JorAiSmUQ7kNvwFepFzX&_nc_oc=AdohMJoEF3rFWEjOTu8rSJ5E5j90PMDX9UBM6JWewnWPx7LRYLIz1TGmtgQ-OQMlExg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL8EUZlO1QMzoPqaxAPQCjQMjhHjIE6pz6L0i7sjIQwQA&oe=6A9971B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bMTFyLpiIlgQ7kNvwGpgZQD&_nc_oc=AdrhzOlgJpG2V_c2jZVKOeXHmczLlVKGxrMlKAPALSgsHOP_6sAdH4UnTvW5mBMatD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIxWeaI_RjldRd0wMkw76xQqINMYN08s4Y14Bp-D8nEVg&oe=6A998493"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n-K_VRrqL7UQ7kNvwHuSsy1&_nc_oc=AdpZ_ExySTy756nHMDbqCh4xjI-qMSM8ZPvq2I2QtCczLhCdc6gfsfjz7Df0YOTVhsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ7X7Ljr_XaKLSfNFITEWd84p7aRb42t6CP3mvMjjiUqw&oe=6A9982DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: